	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『デジモンアドベンチャー』より、ウォーグレイモンがFigure-rise Standard Amplifiedで登場！",
			"• 原作リスペクトの元、キャラクターの魅力を“増幅”させたAMPLIFIEDシリーズ第1弾！",
			"• ６色に及ぶ成形色構成により、組み立てるだけで満足できるパーツ分割。",
			"• 両腕のドラモンキラーは着脱式で、片腕にまとめて取り付けることが可能。",
			"• ブレイブシールドは翼のように展開する構造を採用。さらに取り外して腕部に付け替えることも可能。",
			"• 拡張用３mm穴がプラモデルとしての可能性をさらに増幅(AMPLIFIED)。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Digimon Adventure\", WarGreymon appears in Figure-rise Standard Amplified!",
			"• The first in the AMPLIFIED series, which respects the original work and amplifies the charm of the characters!",
			"• With a molding color configuration of 6 colors, parts division can be satisfied with just assembly.",
			"• The Dramon Killers on both arms are removable and can be attached to one arm all at once.",
			"• Brave Sealdo adopts a structure that expands like wings. It is also possible to remove it and attach it to the arm.",
			"• 3mm hole for expansion further amplifies the possibility as a plastic model (AMPLIFIED)."
		]
	},
